# Limitations of Free Version

As we are working with a Free version of the Posit Cloud, please consider the following limitations.

- **Only 1 hour of continuous use is possible for a project**. When 1 hour is reached the project will be closed and you need to re-open it. Consider this to save your files and data regular.

- **Only 25 hours/month of total use is allowed.** Your user can only make use of 25 hours of the cloud service during a month. Once these hours are reached the project could not be used until the next month.

For working with these limitations the following recommendations are suggested:

1.  **Be sure to exit the project once you finish working with it.** This will avoid the use of unnecessary hours.

2.  **Be sure to log out once you finish working with the Posit Cloud service.** This will avoid the use of unnecessary hours as **while your are logged in your projects are running in the background.**

In case of reaching these limitations you can try to create another account to have another 25 hours available.
